{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img src=\"https://img.tvb.com/inews_admin/pro/20260513/entry_horizontal_6a050c5fb0221bc870dddada_1778716467490_640x360.jpg\"><p>文遠知行上季度虧損，按年擴大百分之1，蝕近3.9億元人民幣。經調整虧損擴大一成，蝕3.26億元人民幣。</p><p>期內收入升逾五成七，超過1.1億元人民幣。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-14T00:36:53.491578+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":73,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}